<!DOCTYPE html>

<html>
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8"/>

        <title>Meeting Minutes</title>

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/global.css">
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/index.css">

        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/popup.css">
        <script src="/javascript/popups.js"></script>
    </head>
    <body>
        <header>
            <h1>Meeting Minutes</h1>
            <h2>A central server for corps. to post and store meeting minutes</h2>
        </header>

        <section>
            <aside>
                <script>
                    (async () => {
                        userData = await getUserData();

                        console.log(userData)

                        if (userData.loggedIn === true) {
                            document.getElementById("account-button").innerHTML = "Log Out";
                            
                            document.getElementById("account-button").onclick = async() => {
                                try {
                                    const response = await fetch('/api/account/logout', {
                                        method: 'POST',
                                        credentials: "include"
                                    });

                                    if (response.ok) {
                                        const html = await response.text();
                                        document.body.innerHTML = html;
                                    }
                                } catch (error) {
                                    console.error("Logout error:", error);
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    })();
                </script>

                <button onclick="open_popup()" id="account-button">Log In</button>
                <%- include('resources/navpanel') -%>
            </aside>

            <div class="content">
                <div class="desc-wrapper">
                    <h2>About</h2>
                    <p>This website is the frontend for a database geared toward the corperations of a Democratic/Sudbury school, and was created in response to the lack of coordination regarding meeting minutes.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="desc-wrapper">
                    <h2>How to use</h2>
                    <p>To upload content to this website, you first need an account with upload access to the page you're looking to upload to. Assuming you have an account, go to your corperation's page, click the "Add Minutes" button in the top right corner and upload the minutes file and fill out all the required information. After that, reload the page to see the new entry. For a more detailed guide, go to the <a href="/help">help</a> page.</p>
                </div class="desc-wrapper">
                
                <div class="desc-wrapper">
                    <h2>I want my corp. on here!</h2>
                    <p>If you want to see your corp. here, contact <a href="mailto:<%= admin %>"><%= admin %></a>, or the the administrator in person if possible</p>
                </div class="desc-wrapper">

                <div class="desc-wrapper">
                    <h2>I want a more professional looking website</h2>
                    <p>Feel free to make one, or modify this one. This project is open source, so feel free to contribute code or content. The source code for this project is hosted on github.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Log in/out popups -->
        <div class="popup-backdrop" id="popup-backdrop">
            <div class="popup-box">
                <h2>Login</h2>
                <form action="http://localhost:3000/api/account/login" method="POST">
                    <label>Email: <input type="email" name="email"/></label>
                    <label>Password: <input type="password" name="password"/></label>

	                <input type="submit" class="submitInput" value="Submit">
                </form>
                <button onclick="close_popup()">Close</button>
            </div>
        </div>

    </body>
</html>